aiy-voicebonnet-soundcard-dkms (3.0-1.4) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Non-maintainer upload.
  * Update rt5645/rl6231 codec drivers to support 6.18 kernel, synced
    with raspberrypi/linux rpi-6.18.y and reapplied the AIY-specific
    jack-detection quirks (charge-pump workaround, jd_mode-gated
    IN1 handling, CODEC_TYPE_RT5645 jack-detect sequence, and
    realtek,jd-invert devicetree property support) on top
  * snd-aiy-voicebonnet: use renamed SND_SOC_DAIFMT_CBC_CFC in place
    of the removed SND_SOC_DAIFMT_CBS_CFS
  * debian: add dh-dkms to Build-Depends (needed for dh_dkms used
    in debian/rules)

